00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:22.300
more way in which I'll never measure up until I get to heaven."

86
00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.420
Right? Can't be holy, can't do that.

87
00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:30.040
If you're wearing possibility glasses, though, you would say, "Oh,

